{
  "summary": "This experiment tested weighted fusion in a multimodal multiprofile setup using scvi_n200 RNA encoding and ViT-L image encoding, achieving validation accuracy of 0.7062 (vs. 0.7150 for concat fusion in config_036). The lower accuracy suggests weighted fusion may not improve performance compared to concatenation, though the small difference and lack of direct comparison to other fusion strategies leave uncertainty about its effectiveness. The role of encoder choices or aggregation remains unclear without further isolation."
}

